{"id":"anciens","lemma":"anciens","pos":"noun","rank":1517,"glosses":["forefathers"],"gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-anciens.wav","examples":[{"text":"Nous avons enlevé les anciens meubles.","en":"We removed the old furniture.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to remove","l":"enlever"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to furnish","l":"meubler"}]},{"text":"Elle a quelques beaux meubles anciens.","en":"She has some beautiful antique furniture.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"},{"g":"to furnish","l":"meubler"},null]},{"text":"C'est un de mes anciens élèves.","en":"He's a former student of mine.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"to raise","l":"élever"}]},{"text":"C'est populaire chez les anciens.","en":"It's popular among the elderly.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"people's"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"J'adore les ouvrages anciens.","en":"I love old books.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love, to adore","l":"adorer"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"work, labour","l":"ouvrage"},null]}]}